OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy start
OL,6,Fwith light rain possible, turning
OL,7,Fdrier with some clear intervals
OL,8,Fdeveloping through the evening. Some
OL,9,Fclear intervals overnight, although a
OL,10,Ffew heavier showers will spread
OL,11,Feastwards. Rather cold.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FBright or sunny spells with
OL,14,Fthe odd shower possible at first.
OL,15,FBecoming drier through the morning to
OL,16,Fleave a dry afternoon with sunny
OL,17,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
