OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fand breezy with heavy rain clearing to
OL,7,Fthe north through Friday. Further
OL,8,Fspells of heavy rain over the weekend
OL,9,Fwith winds strengthening and bringing
OL,10,Fa risk of gales.
